# Paper C raw spectral dumps that exceed github's 100 MB-per-file
# limit. Phase C-1's full JSON stores per-state-unit flat lists
# (5.24 M floats each for A_log_flat and rho_static_flat), which
# bloats to ~257 MB. We commit the abridged *_summary.json
# instead. Other phases (C-1b onwards) use streaming aggregation
# and are committed in full.
paper_c/results_c/phase_c1_ssm_spectral_baseline.json
!paper_c/results_c/phase_c1_ssm_spectral_baseline_summary.json
